# Validation after the WAL append: a rejected write has already changed data.
MODULE: RejectLeavesNoMutationAppendedFirst
TARGET: RejectLeavesNoMutation
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a rejected write is appended before the rejection is thrown
PERTURBS: Write

--- FIND
       ELSE /\ outcome' = "Rejected"
            /\ UNCHANGED <<data, commits>>
--- REPLACE
       ELSE /\ outcome' = "Rejected"
            /\ data' = v /\ commits' = commits + 1
--- END
